{"FilterViewResults renders GrafanaRuleListItem in a rules.map(...) branch without a React key, unlike other branches. This causes React warnings and can lead to incorrect component state reuse when the filtered list changes.": 0.7519221901893616, "In the list-view path that no longer fetches Ruler rules, AlertRuleMenu can enable Grafana Prom-rule abilities (Silence/Delete) but the surrounding components still require a Ruler rule to execute/render those actions. 'Silence notifications' can appear but opens no drawer, and 'Delete' can be permitted but never rendered.": 0.7620220184326172, "GrafanaGroupLoader calls .map() on promResponse.data.groups.at(0)?.rules without optional-chaining rules. If the API returns an empty groups array, this becomes undefined.map(...) and crashes the view.": 0.8802986741065979}